tab gpu | GPU | developer_board

sub sched | Scheduling & display

tweak gpu.mpo | layers | rec reboot
  name  Multi-plane overlay off
  desc  Turns off MPO, which fixes flicker, black screens and stutter on many NVIDIA and AMD setups, especially with mixed refresh rates.
  R     M\Windows\Dwm | OverlayTestMode | d:5 | -

tweak gpu.hags | developer_board | reboot
  name  Hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling
  desc  Lets the GPU manage its own memory and scheduling. Needed for DLSS frame generation; on some older drivers it adds stutter, so turning it off can help.
  opt   on | On
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers | HwSchMode | d:2 | -
  opt   off | Off
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers | HwSchMode | d:1 | -
  opt   default | Driver default
  R-    CC\GraphicsDrivers | HwSchMode

tweak gpu.nvcp | settings_applications | action nvidia
  name  Repair NVIDIA Control Panel
  desc  Sets the NVIDIA display container services back to automatic and starts them, which brings back a missing or crashing NVIDIA Control Panel.
  SVCS  2 | NVDisplay.ContainerLocalSystem NvContainerLocalSystem NvContainerNetworkService
  START NVDisplay.ContainerLocalSystem NvContainerLocalSystem NvContainerNetworkService

tweak gpu.tdr | restart_alt | rec reboot
  name  GPU timeout recovery
  desc  Gives the driver 8 seconds instead of 2 before Windows resets a busy GPU, so heavy shader compiles and loading screens do not crash with a TDR.
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers | TdrLevel | d:3 | -
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers | TdrDelay | d:8 | -
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers | TdrDdiDelay | d:8 | -

tweak gpu.energy | eco | rec
  name  GPU energy efficiency off
  desc  Turns off the graphics kernel's energy-efficiency mode, which lowers GPU clocks on light loads.
  R     CC\GraphicsDrivers\Power | EnergyEfficiency | d:0 | -

tweak gpu.msi | settings_input_component | reboot risk2
  name  MSI interrupt mode
  desc  Switches the GPU, network, NVMe, audio and USB controllers to message-signaled interrupts, which have lower latency than shared line interrupts. Virtual machines are skipped.
  MSI

sub nvidia | NVIDIA

tweak gpu.nvlog | visibility_off | rec nvidia
  name  NVIDIA driver logging & telemetry off
  desc  Turns off the driver's event tracer, log entries, telemetry upload, tray icons and the DLSS indicator, and opts out of NVIDIA data collection.
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | LogWarningEntries | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | LogPagingEntries | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | LogEventEntries | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | LogErrorEntries | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | RMEnableEventTracer | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | RMResetPerfMonD4 | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Global\Startup | SendTelemetryData | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Global\NVTweak | HideXGpuTrayIcon | d:1 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\NvControlPanel2\Client | OptInOrOutPreference | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\NVIDIA Corporation\NVControlPanel2\Client | OptInOrOutPreference | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\NvTray | StartOnLogin | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\CoProcManager | ShowTrayIcon | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\NGXCore | ShowDlssIndicator | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID44231_20160715_152522477 | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID64640_20160715_152522477 | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID66610_20160715_152522477 | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID44231 | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID64640 | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\FTS | EnableRID66610 | d:0 | -
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RMEnableEventTracer | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RMResetPerfMonD4 | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RmLogonRC | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RMIntrDetailedLogs | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RMCtxswLog | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\* | RMNvLog | d:0 | - | ?nv
  R     HKCU\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\GFExperience | NotifyNewDisplayUpdates | d:0 | -
  T     disable \NvTmMon*
  DELDIR %ProgramFiles%\NVIDIA Corporation\DisplayDriverRAS
  DELDIR %ProgramData%\NVIDIA Corporation\DisplayDriverRAS

tweak gpu.nvpower | bolt | desktop risk2 reboot nvidia
  name  NVIDIA power saving off
  desc  Keeps NVIDIA GPUs out of their clock-gating, power-gating, GC6 and PCIe link sleep states, and disables display power saving. Desktops only: higher idle power and temperature.
  NVSET DisableDynamicPstate=1 RMHdcpKeyglobZero=1 RmDisableHwFaultBuffer=1 RMDisablePerIntrDPCQueueing=1 RMHotPlugSupportDisable=1 RmFbsrPagedDMA=1 RMDisablePostL2Compression=1
  NVSET DisableAsyncPstates=1 SlideMCLK=0 RMGCOffFeature=2 RmSec2EnableApm=0 RmDisableInforomBBX=15 RmMIONoPowerOff=1 RMDisableOptimalPowerForPadlinkPll=1
  NVSET RMEnableASPMDT=1 RMEnableASPMAtLoad=0 PerfLevelSrc=8738 D3PCLatency=1 EnableRuntimePowerManagement=0 RmProfilingAdminOnly=0
  NVSET RMElcg=1431655765 RMBlcg=286331153 RMElpg=4095 RMSlcg=262131 RMFspg=15 RMGC6Feature=699050 RMGC6Parameters=85 RMDidleFeatureGC5=44731050
  NVSET RMPcieLtrOverride=1 RMPcieLtrL12ThresholdOverride=0 RMDeepL1EntryLatencyUsec=1 RmOverrideIdleSlowdownSettings=0 RMClkSlowDown=71303168 RMUsbcDebugMode=0 PreferSystemMemoryContiguous=1
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Global\NVTweak | DisplayPowerSaving | d:0 | -
  R     HKLM\SOFTWARE\NVIDIA Corporation\Global\NVTweak | DisplayPowerSaving | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Global\NVTweak | RmProfilingAdminOnly | d:0 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Global\NVTweak | NvDevToolsVisible | d:1 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm | PreferSystemMemoryContiguous | d:1 | -
  R     SV\nvlddmkm | EnableHDAudioD3Cold | d:0 | -

tweak gpu.nvecc | memory | desktop risk2 reboot nvidia
  name  NVIDIA ECC & memory scrubbing off
  desc  Turns off ECC checks and video memory scrubbing on GeForce cards (workstation cards are skipped), and silences the driver's verbose log masks.
  NVSET RMAERRForceDisable=1 RMNoECCFuseCheck=1 RMDisableRCOnDBE=1 RM1441072=1 RMAERRHandling=0 RMEnableL1ECC=0 RMEnableSMECC=0 RMEnableSHMECC=0 RMAssertOnEccErrors=0 ?geforce
  NVSET RMGuestECCState=0 RMNoECCFBScrub=1 RMDisableScrubOnFree=1 RMDisableAsyncMemScrub=1 RMDisableFastScrubber=1 RMInitScrub=0 RmForceGrScrubberChannel=0 ?geforce
  R     SV\nvlddmkm\Parameters | LogDisableMasks | b: | -

tweak gpu.nvprofile | tune | rec nvidia
  name  NVIDIA 3D settings profile
  desc  Sets the global 3D settings through the NVIDIA driver itself, no extra tools: low latency mode, one pre-rendered frame, unlimited shader cache, threaded optimization, highest refresh rate, and driver-forced antialiasing, FXAA, sharpening, Ansel and Whisper Mode off. Desktop also forces V-Sync off, prefers maximum performance and turns off triple buffering. Takes effect right away, no restart.
  opt   desktop | Desktop
  USE   _common
  NVDRS 390467 2 | Low Latency Mode: Ultra
  NVDRS 11041231 138504007 | Vertical sync: force off
  NVDRS 274197361 1 | Power management: prefer maximum performance
  NVDRS 553505273 0 | Triple buffering: off
  opt   laptop | Laptop
  USE   _common
  NVDRS 390467 1 | Low Latency Mode: On
  opt   _common | -
  NVDRS 1675263 1 | Shader cache: on
  NVDRS 11306135 4294967295 | Shader cache size: unlimited
  NVDRS 8102046 1 | Max pre-rendered frames: 1
  NVDRS 546199011 1 | Max frames allowed: 1
  NVDRS 269553971 1 | VR pre-rendered frames: 1
  NVDRS 6600001 1 | Preferred refresh rate: highest available
  NVDRS 549528094 1 | Threaded optimization: on
  NVDRS 13510289 20 | Texture filtering quality: high performance
  NVDRS 1686376 0 | Texture filtering negative LOD bias: allow
  NVDRS 6524559 0 | Driver-controlled LOD bias: off
  NVDRS 544832876 20 | OpenGL rendering quality: high performance
  NVDRS 544392611 0 | OpenGL GDI compatibility: off
  NVDRS 283962569 1 | CUDA system memory fallback: prefer none
  NVDRS 1343646814 0 | CUDA force P2 state: off
  NVDRS 546816758 0 | Deep colour for 3D apps: off
  NVDRS 276757595 1 | Antialiasing mode: application-controlled
  NVDRS 282555346 0 | Antialiasing setting: off
  NVDRS 276652957 0 | Antialiasing gamma correction: off
  NVDRS 283958146 0 | Antialiasing behaviour flags: none
  NVDRS 282364549 0 | Transparency supersampling: off
  NVDRS 284962204 0 | Transparency multisampling: off
  NVDRS 545898348 0 | Antialiasing line gamma: off
  NVDRS 10011052 0 | MFAA: off
  NVDRS 276089202 0 | FXAA: off
  NVDRS 271895433 0 | Predefined FXAA usage: off
  NVDRS 5867849 0 | Predefined sharpening usage: off
  NVDRS 276158834 0 | Ansel: off
  NVDRS 271965065 0 | Predefined Ansel usage: off
  NVDRS 9990737 0 | SILK smoothness: off
  NVDRS 270198627 0 | Smooth AFR: off
  NVDRS 277041152 0 | Frame rate limiter low latency: off
  NVDRS 269573258 0 | Whisper Mode: off
  NVDRS 269573259 0 | Whisper Mode app FPS: off
  NVDRS 11241095 0 | VAB default data: off

sub amd | AMD

tweak gpu.amdfeat | auto_fix_off | rec amd
  name  AMD driver extras off
  desc  Turns off Radeon Chill, Anti-Lag driver hooks, Radeon Boost, ULPS sleep and USU, and sets the 3D profile to performance.
  AMDSET KMD_USUEnable=0 KMD_ChillEnabled=0 KMD_DeLagEnabled=0 KMD_RadeonBoostEnabled=0 EnableUlps=0
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\*\UMD | Main3D_DEF | s:1 | - | ?amd
  R     CC\Class\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}\*\UMD | Main3D | b:3100 | - | ?amd
  R     SV\amdwddmg | ChillEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\AMD\CN | AnimationEffect | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\AMD\CN | AutoUpdateTriggered | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\Software\AMD\CN | PowerSaverAutoEnable_cur | d:0 | -

tweak gpu.amdpower | bolt | desktop risk2 reboot amd
  name  AMD power saving off
  desc  Forces high DPM states and turns off clock gating, power gating, light sleep and PCIe ASPM on Radeon cards. Desktops only: higher idle power and temperature.
  AMDSET PP_Force3DPerformanceMode=1 PP_ForceHighDPMLevel=1 PP_GPUPowerDownEnabled=0 DisableDynamicPstate=1 DisableDrmdmaPowerGating=1
  AMDSET DisableGfxCoarseGrainLightSleep=1 DisableGfxCpLightSleep=1 DisableGfxMediumGrainLightSleep=1 DisableGfxRlcLightSleep=1 DisableDrmLightSleep=1
  AMDSET DisableGfxClockGating=1 DisableSysClockGating=1 DisableVceClockGating=1 DisableAllClockGating=1 DisablePowerGating=1 DisableCpPowerGating=1 DisableUVDPowerGatingDynamic=1 DisableVCEPowerGating=1
  AMDSET DisableAspmL0s=1 DisableAspmL1=1 DisableAspmSWL1=1 EnableAspmL0s=0 EnableAspmL1=0 EnableAspmL1SS=0 AspmL0sTimeout=0 AspmL1Timeout=0
  AMDSET DisableClkReqSupport=1 DisableFBCSupport=1 EnableSpreadSpectrum=0 DalDisableClockGating=1
  AMDSET DisableGfx3DCGLS=1 DisableGfxCGTS=1 DisableGfxCGTS_LS=1 DisableGfxMGCGPerfMon=1 DisableDrmdmaMGCG=1 DisableDrmMGCG=1 DisableGfx3DCGCG=1 EnableUvdClockGating=0 EnableVceSwClockGating=0
  AMDSET EnableGfxClockGatingThruSmu=0 EnableSysClockGatingThruSmu=0 IRQMgrDisableIHClockGating=1 DisableRomMediumGrainClockGating=1 DisableRomMGCGClockGating=1 DisableSamuClockGating=1
  AMDSET DisableGfxCoarseGrainClockGating=1 DisableGfxMediumGrainClockGating=1 DisableMcMediumGrainClockGating=1 DisableNbioMediumGrainClockGating=1 DisableAcpPowerGating=1 DisableDynamicGfxMGPowerGating=1
  AMDSET DisableGDSPowerGating=1 DisableGfxCGPowerGating=1 DisableGFXPipelinePowerGating=1 DisableQuickGfxMGPowerGating=1 DisableSAMUPowerGating=1 DisableStaticGfxMGPowerGating=1 DisableXdmaPowerGating=1 DisableXdmaSclkGating=1
